 8 |     slow = b | lowpass(10),
   |            --------------- 500 Hz (from /1/field)
 9 |     a,
   |     ^ 1 kHz (from /0/field)
10 |     c)
   |     - 44.1 kHz (from /2/field)
   |
   = note: alignment never resamples on its own — interpolating without
           being asked would change your numbers invisibly.
   = help: match the rate first, ahead of any filtering:
             let three = align(
                 slow = b | lowpass(10),
                 a | decimate(2),
                 c | resample(500))
   = note: decimating after the filters would compile, but the arms would
           carry different coefficients and mismatched phase.
